        alt: "Photo uploads in Knockio",
      },
      {
        title: "Instant Activation & Monthly Invoicing",
        text: "Record the payment method on the account during doorstep sign-up. Automatically trigger initial installation fees and begin recurring monthly subscription recurring invoicing the moment dBm light levels are verified.",
